    "description": "Direction compass is your ultimate level tool, weather radar for sureness and assistance. Digital Compass is for those seeking an accurate compass app to guide them in every perspective of life. Smart compass 2024 is comfortable to find your direction compass for Kaaba. Virtual compass app is metal detector and smart compass navigation to find qibla direction Mecca in any angle. For an accurate compass direction finder use a magnetic compass with a magnetic sensor. Smart compass for android-digital compass 360 allows you to know coordinates latitude & longitude from virtual compass free. Compass app easily guide Qibla directions to hike North, South, West and East by directions compass & get accuracy through virtual compass. Digital compass is a size direction locator.\r\nFree compass app is a digital compass for android users as prismatic compass and rustic compass. Change direction by guide directions at my altitude by altitude app using altimeter compass. In directions compass, how to use compass for Kaaba and virtual compass for correct direction. Commander compass for screen capture after magnifying anything from camera compass free. You can't be lost by land navigation & GPS compass map because it\u2019s a smart compass navigation & compass clock with compass steel for free compass users. Compass app & commander compass is also a spyglass, led compass for compass real estate and compass for android. Accurate compass free use for hunting, camping, boating and military uses, hiking free compass.\r\nQibla compass direction is a GPS compass map for Muslims to find accurate qibla direction with my compass & compass camera. Qibla direction compass helps to find Mecca accurate kaaba direction, qibla compass for namaz. Kaba and Islamic qibla finder for all of different countries Muslims with compass for qibla direction, its qibla direction app. Qibla compass with qibla finder easily finds compass for qibla direction. Smart compass app for compass free direction towards Mecca for your prayers.\r\n<b>\u2604\ufe0fAdvanced Features </b>\r\n\uf0ae\tTemperature of any place with compass 360 wader\r\n\uf0ae\tTelescope compass to gather and focus light\r\n\uf0ae\tStandard, digital and wind compass modes\r\n\uf0ae\tCompass notification\r\n\uf0ae\tElevation app\r\n\uf0ae\tDifferent types broken compass \r\n\uf0ae\tMultiple language compass rose interface\r\n\uf0ae\tLive compass navigation for your current location\r\n\uf0ae\tCamera compass and magnifying glass\r\n\uf0ae\tDay & night mode\r\n\uf0ae\tGPS and map supported\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd4cFind Mosque</b>\r\nMy compass is a mosque finder for the nearest mosque location to offer prayer. You can use masjid finder for mosque location with compass lite. Compass lite is a mosque locator app.\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf26The weather updates </b>\r\nFrom live weather app, get a real-time forecast, weather map and weather live information for your current location from the free weather app. The weather app free for the weather forecast at any time. Weather radar app free tracks the local weather, dark sky weather for everyone in the world to weather free app users.\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcd0Spirit Meter or bubble level</b>\r\nMeasure surface level with level tool or bubble level. This level app, tools smart level the perfect alignment with leveler & bubble level free. Solocator for leveler and surface level. Spirit level made simple for all projects in measuring with precision.\r\n<b>\u2723Morse code</b>\r\nMorse code trainer send messages using classic Morse code functionality. The morse code gives an interactive way to learn with this timeless code. Morse used for coding the interaction in different languages with morse light.\r\nPlease feel free to contact on masa36370@gmail.com for your precious suggestions and feedback.",
